++// GucciBot patch (patches/bindings-g6-union-renames.patch), Eibyx/gd-mods
++// port for Geode 6.0.0: since 23aa2a93 an old name kept by renamed_from is a
++// __declspec(property). A property can't be used in offsetof/sizeof(T::m) and
++// its getter isn't const, and GucciBot does both (world/offsets.hpp,
++// ac/framewindow.cpp, world/capture.cpp). For plain scalars and pointers the
++// old names are a union with the new one again, as before 23aa2a93 (same
++// layout, still copyable). Class types keep the upstream property aliases.
